concept:australian-human-rights-commission-act-1986-article-3-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "3 Schedule 2  International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-3-2 ;
    values:originalText "Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  The States Parties to the present Covenant undertake to ensure the equal right of men and women to the enjoyment of all civil and political rights set forth in the present Covenant." ;
