    skos:prefLabel "35 The members of the Committee shall, with the approval of the General"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-35 ;
    values:originalText "Assembly of the United Nations, receive emoluments from United Nations resources on such terms and conditions as the General Assembly may decide, having regard to the importance of the Committee’s responsibilities." ;
