concept:australian-human-rights-commission-act-1986-article-36 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36 Schedule 2  International Covenant on Civil and Political Rights"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:article-36 ;
    values:originalText "Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  The Secretary-General of the United Nations shall provide the necessary staff and facilities for the effective performance of the functions of the Committee under the present Covenant." ;
    skos:definition "Australian Human Rights Commission Act 1986  Compilation date: 04/06/2026  The Secretary-General of the United Nations shall provide the necessary staff and facilities for the effective performance of the functions of the Committee under the present Covenant."@en ;
