concept:australian-human-rights-commission-act-1986-article-39 cml:asserts concept:australian-human-rights-commission-act-1986-article-39-logic-deontic-1 .
concept:australian-human-rights-commission-act-1986-article-39-logic-deontic-1 a cml:LogicApplication ;
    cml:modality cml:Deontic ;
